# `agents.stop`

Stop a running agent by slug.

**Policy** — command `[C2_ELEVATED]`. Capability `ship.agents.write`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `slug` | `string` |

## Returns

`StopResult` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `slug` | `string` |
| `stopped` | `bool` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.stop --json '{ "slug": "" }'
```

Kind: command.

## Example response

```json
{
  "slug": "harbor-7f3a9c",
  "stopped": true
}
```
